Module seized "The Weights, who take the forsworn and cannot be fought" {
  Place quay "the quay" is room at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place wall "the black wall" is room at 1, 0 outdoors.
  Place cells "the Weights' cells" is room at 2, 0 indoors.
  Passage steps "the steps to the black wall" between quay and wall.
  Company party "You" of 1 at quay.
  Person weights "the Weights" at wall { Role "bailiffs of bronze". Species golem. Numbers 2. Temperament seizing.
    Warns "Two figures of bronze turn their faces to you, and hold out their hands, palm up. Not yet.".
    Comes "The Weights take you by the arms, and there is no pulling free.". }
  Rule taken_down when captured(weights, party) and at(party, wall) {
    Retract at(party, wall). Assert at(party, cells).
  }
}
